@page "/you-hold-the-keys"
<PageTitle>You hold the keys · Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <h1 class="ta-visually-hidden">You hold the keys</h1>   @* The menu already names the page; the heading is kept for screen readers and search. *@
    <p class="ta-page-idea">A new company should have to earn your trust.</p>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">So we built Tangent Atlas to need as little of it as possible.</p>

    <div class="ta-trust">
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10l9-6 9 6"></path><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="5" y2="18"></line><line x1="10" y1="10" x2="10" y2="18"></line><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="14" y2="18"></line><line x1="19" y1="10" x2="19" y2="18"></line><line x1="3" y1="20" x2="21" y2="20"></line></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">Your money stays where it is</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">We work with the accounts you already have. Your cash, your shares and your cards stay at your own bank, broker and card issuer. We bring them together in one dashboard, and we never hold a dollar.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"></path></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">We never see your passwords</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">You sign in at your own bank or broker separately. They issue an OAuth token that lets us act on your behalf, only in the ways you allow, and you can take it back at any time.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17" rx="2"></rect><path d="M9 4V3h6v1"></path><polyline points="8.5 12 11 14.5 15.5 10"></polyline></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">Nothing moves until you approve it</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">Every trade and transfer waits for your OK until you choose to let your rules run on their own. Everything we do is logged with the rule behind it, so you can always see what was done and why.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline><polyline points="16 6 22 12 16 18"></polyline></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">Read the code</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">The software that handles your money is open source, on GitHub, so anyone can check it. It runs on Microsoft Azure, Microsoft handles every sign-in, and we build to published security standards.</div>
            <a href="https://github.com/tangent-atlas" class="ta-more-link">See it on GitHub →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ta-page-final">
        <p class="ta-page-close">You keep the keys. We keep earning your trust.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</div>
